## 21-Day Build Journey

| Week | What I Built |
|------|-------------|
| Week 1 | CPU: ALU + Register File + Pipeline |
| Week 2 | Protocols: UART + SPI + I2C + PWM |
| Week 3 | BharatSE: AES + PUF + Tamper |

